# Send only runtime source, dependency locks and container tooling to the builder.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!backend/
!backend/**
!ml/
!ml/**
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!docker/
!docker/**
# The processed table and cited text corpus the API reads, so the image runs in real mode on its
# own (e.g. on a host without bind mounts). Raw uploads and clean CSVs stay out.
!data/processed/
!data/processed/**
!data/docs/
!data/docs/**

# Never bake local environments, caches, private plans or raw/downloaded data in. The committed
# model artifacts (ml/artifacts) are included with ml/ above, for the same reason as the data.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
backend/tests
ml/tests
